ORIGIN

This add-on replaces one of the WP2Static add-ons by Leon Stafford, released
into the public domain under the Unlicense. Public-domain work can be
redistributed under any terms, and VibeStatic ships under the GPL because that
is what WordPress plugins are distributed under. Nothing here removes anyone's
rights in the original, which stays public domain where it stands.
